= Heinrich Brandler

Brandler is the chairman of the party, a former tiler and union organizer from Chemnitz. He believes the party must win the workers who still follow the SPD and the unions before it can lead them anywhere, and he has the backing of the Right. In Moscow he is treated as a loyal man, and also as a man who may not always do what he is told.

